[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104] STEP PURPOSE
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104] --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   Step 104 -- spatial holdout and axis localization of the slip map.
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   Step 102 validated the bipolar slip map under random five-fold
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   partitions and cross-catalogue transfer.  Random folds, however,
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   leave a spatially neighbouring twin of every held-out comet inside
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   the training set, so they cannot distinguish a genuine sky field
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   from a pattern carried by a few clustered objects.  This step
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   closes that loophole and turns the validation into a localization
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   measurement:
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   T1  azimuthal spatial holdout (pooled, n = 229).  Per-comet
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   aphelion unit vectors are reconstructed from the catalogues'
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   original-orbit elements (the same construction step 063 uses
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   for theta) and the sky is split in half by a great circle
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   through the axis; the map dtau = a + b*cos(2*theta) is fitted
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   on one half and used to predict the signed slip of the other.
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   Four dividing planes (0, 45, 90, 135 deg offsets) are scored
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   in both directions.  If the map is real spatial structure it
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   must transfer across the split; if it is driven by one
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   clustered region it cannot.
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   T2  band extrapolation (pooled).  The map is fitted excluding the
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   mirror cap (theta > 120 deg) and extrapolated into it: the
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   bipolar form predicts the lobe's sign to reappear unseen.
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   The reverse -- fit on theta > 60 deg, predict the primary
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   cap -- is scored identically.  An extrapolation test of
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   bipolarity that random folds cannot perform.
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   T3  axis-displacement skill curve (pooled).  The assumed axis is
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   displaced by delta = 0..90 deg along eight azimuthal
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   directions; theta is recomputed per comet from the
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   reconstructed aphelion vectors and the five-fold
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   out-of-sample skill re-measured.  A real boundary makes the
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   skill peak at delta = 0 and decay with displacement; the
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   decay scale measures how sharply the comet cohort alone
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   localizes the axis.
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   T4  fold-partition stability (pooled).  The five-fold CV of
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   step 102 is repeated over 200 random partitions; the
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   distribution of out-of-sample rho reports the stability of
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   the measured skill against the fold draw.
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   The model is the pre-declared two-parameter form of step 089 /
[2026-09-20 12:19:47 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 104]   step 102; nothing is re-tuned.  All randomness uses fixed seeds.
